Most courses are organised by **tool**: a week of pandas, a week of regression. Companies hire you to solve **problems**: "Which customers will leave?", "How much stock do we need next week?", "Is this machine about to fail?". These learning paths are organised by problem. Each one tells you what to learn, in what order, on which open dataset, and how to measure success in business terms. 🏭

::: {.callout-tip}
## 🎯 What you will get
- The shared foundation every path builds on
- A six-stage workflow used across industry projects
- An **animated roadmap** for eight use cases, each with an open dataset and metric
- A skills profile per use case
- A worked example that turns a churn model into **dollars saved**
:::

::: {.callout-note appearance="simple"}
