## 🔄 The six-stage industry workflow

Industry projects follow a loop very close to **CRISP-DM**, the cross-industry standard process for data mining. Notice that modelling is only one of six stages.

```{mermaid}
%%| echo: false
flowchart TB
  A["💼 1. Business<br/>understanding"] --> B["🔍 2. Data<br/>understanding"]
  B --> C["🧹 3. Data<br/>preparation"]
  C --> D["🤖 4. Modelling"]
  D --> E["✅ 5. Evaluation<br/>in business terms"]
  E --> F["🚀 6. Deployment<br/>and monitoring"]
  E -. not good enough .-> A
  F -. new data, drift .-> B
```

::: {.callout-note}
## 📝 Note
In real projects, stages 1 to 3 often take more than half the time. A model that answers the wrong business question is worthless, however accurate it is.
:::

