- Learn by **problem**, not by tool: pick one use case and follow its six stages.
- Each path has an **open dataset, a model metric and a business KPI**; report all three.
- Start with a **simple baseline**, then improve.
- Translate model output into **money or time saved**, as in the churn profit curve.
- Next: keep the [cheat sheets](/resources/cheat-sheets/data-science-cheat-sheets.qmd) 📝 open while you work.
